      "en": "For all the gods of the peoples are idols, but the LORD made the heavens.",
      "ko": "만방의 모든 신은 헛 것이요 여호와께서는 하늘을 지으셨음이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "34d02f39c407dca2a9eecb2e69a52998b5826b2f48b05d56c6f8470f9a8875ff",
      "translation_text_hash": "e3ded49728fbecdcf53a22504a0ec33836379b216d6a9b04318dfe5d84b3784d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
